# direnv configuration for Mycelium v2
#
# This automatically activates the Nix development shell when entering
# the directory. Requires:
# - direnv installed and hooked into your shell
# - nix-direnv for faster shell loading (optional but recommended)
#
# Installation:
#   NixOS: Add direnv to your packages
#   Other: https://direnv.net/docs/installation.html

# Use the Nix flake development shell
use flake

# Or if nix-direnv is installed (recommended for caching):
# use flake . --impure
